  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Height in feet and inches vs. centimeters</h2>
    <p>Height is the conversion people look up most, and it is where errors creep in, because feet and inches are 2 units, not 1. Convert everything to inches first (feet × 12 + inches), then multiply by 2.54.</p>
  </div>
